    slug: 'electric-drifting-go-kart',
    title: 'Electric Drifting Go Kart: What to Know Before You Buy in Australia',
    seoTitle: 'Electric Drifting Go Kart: Buyer\'s Guide Australia',
    excerpt: 'Thinking about an electric drifting go kart? See how drift karts work, what to check on the spec sheet and which models we stock. Shop with confidence.',
    category: 'Buying guides', date: '2026-11-02', readTime: '10 min read', targetKeyword: 'electric drifting go kart',
    image: '/blog/electric-drifting-go-kart-v2.webp',
