    excerpt: 'Choosing a dirt buggy in Australia? Compare side-by-side and dune styles, learn what to check on tyres and engines, and see models from $3,429.',
    category: 'Buying guides', date: '2026-11-02', readTime: '10 min read', targetKeyword: 'dirt buggy',
